sequenceDiagram
    participant AP as Ansible Process<br/>(Action Plugin)
    participant SP as subprocess.Popen
    participant MP as Manager Process<br/>(manager_process.py)
    participant PM as PlatformManager
    participant PS as PlatformService
    participant API as AAP Gateway API
    
    Note over AP: First Task Execution
    
    AP->>AP: _get_or_spawn_manager()
    AP->>AP: Extract gateway config (Platform SDK)
    AP->>AP: Check hostvars for existing manager
    AP->>AP: Not found - spawn new manager
    
    AP->>AP: Generate connection info (Platform SDK)
    AP->>SP: ProcessManager.spawn_manager_process(<br/>manager_process.py,<br/>socket_path, gateway_config, ...)
    
    Note over SP: Spawns new process
    
    SP->>MP: Process starts
    MP->>MP: Restore sys.path
    MP->>MP: Decode authkey
    
    MP->>PS: Create PlatformService()
    PS->>API: Authenticate (HTTP)
    API-->>PS: Auth success
    PS->>API: Detect API version
    API-->>PS: Version info
    PS->>PS: Initialize registry & loader
    
    MP->>PM: PlatformManager.register(<br/>'get_platform_service',<br/>callable=lambda: service)
    
    MP->>PM: PlatformManager(<br/>address=socket_path,<br/>authkey=authkey)
    
    MP->>PM: server = manager.get_server()
    MP->>PM: server.serve_forever()
    
    Note over PM: Server listening on Unix socket
    
    MP-->>AP: Socket file created
    
    AP->>AP: Set facts in result dict<br/>(ansible_facts, _ansible_facts_cacheable)
    AP->>AP: Create ManagerRPCClient
    AP->>PM: Connect via Unix socket
    PM-->>AP: Connection established
    
    Note over AP,PM: Manager ready for RPC calls

